  {
    "id": "75716",
    "original": "返事を待つアリスに向けられたのは突然の咆哮。それは耳を貫かんばかりに鋭く、天に届かんばかりに大きく響くものでした。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "328002",
        "text": "What Alice, waiting for a reply, was faced with was a sudden howl. It was a resounding noise, sharp as to burst her ear drums, loud as to reach unto the heavens."
      }
    ],
